			"name": "Show validation problem"
		},
		{
			"parameters": {
				"width": 1200,
				"height": 300,
				"content": "## Zvid n8n manual-review render demo\n\n1. Install `@zvid/n8n-nodes-zvid@0.1.4` from npm.\n2. Create one **Zvid API** credential with a key from https://app.zvid.io/api-keys. Keep the default Base URL: `https://api.zvid.io`.\n3. Select that credential on all four Zvid nodes.\n4. Execute the workflow. **Validate project** is free. **Submit render** spends the quoted 4 credits only after validation succeeds.\n5. The workflow waits 3 seconds, fetches the job, and loops until `state` is `completed`. It fails on a failed job or after 3 minutes.\n6. Open the final `videoUrl` to show the completed result.\n\nThe project JSON has passed live Zvid validation with zero errors and zero layout warnings."
			},
			"type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
			"typeVersion": 1,
			"position": [
				-760,
