				"content": "## Recording note\n\nUse this imported workflow to rehearse and verify the render before recording. For n8n's final manual-review video, create a new workflow and add the essential Zvid nodes live in one continuous take. You may keep this JSON open as prepared material to paste, but do not only present a completed imported workflow."
			},
